# Docker build context is the monorepo root (apps/web/Dockerfile and
# apps/worker/Dockerfile are both built with `-f apps/*/Dockerfile .`) —
# this keeps that context small and avoids ever baking local secrets or
# build artifacts into an image layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
infra/terraform/**/*.tfstate*
infra/terraform/**/.terraform
